    "hypothesis": "The ConvTranspose1d kernel uses an incorrect output indexing formula. The current implementation maps output index lo to input coordinate lin = lo + padding - k, but does not apply the stride scaling before the bounds check. As a result, contributions with lin >= L_in are incorrectly discarded even when the corresponding input index i = lin / stride is valid, causing zeros and mismatches at many output positions.",
